{"id":"2126873bea8294ae","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-uniform-reflection.md","title":"全公式类的统一反射","display":"df-uniform-reflection — 全公式类的统一反射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-uniform-reflection","aliases":["91-df-uniform-reflection","91-df-URF"],"display":"df-uniform-reflection — 全公式类的统一反射","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-uniform-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-uniform-reflection</span><span>91-df-URF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-reflection — 全公式类的统一反射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_S\">\\(\\mathcal L_S\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\)</span> 的数字代入约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URF}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\)</span> 为下述全公式类模式的简写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个实例形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi(\\vec x))\">\\(\\forall\\vec x(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi(\\vec x))\\)</span>，其中点记号只缩写数字代入函数，不能把开放公式的元引号误作对象项。\n统一反射不需要真理谓词。对 PA，UTB 加 PA 的真理化全局反射可推出全部统一反射；UTB 本身仍保守。一个无自由变量的实例退化为局部反射实例。</p>\n<p>来源：§22.1–22.2，印刷页 309–313。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathcal L_S$ 及 $\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)$ 的数字代入约定见 [[91-df-reflection-principle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URF}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi(\\vec x))","display":false}],"bytes":1170,"backlinks":[{"id":"4b28706879995352","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URF}